{"step_index":1557,"source":"MODEL","type":"PLANNER_RESPONSE","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-09-11T23:56:54Z","thinking":"**Verifying Roman Domination Center Eccentricity**\n\nThe conductor tests a condition: for every Roman dominating function, does a center in $V_2$ exist with eccentricity less than or equal to $W-1$? A python snippet calculates the minimum eccentricity among centers in $V_2$. The code checks if this minimum eccentricity is indeed less than or equal to $W-1$. This computation determines the existence of such a vertex. A script will be executed to determine if there always exists such a vertex.\n\n\n","tool_calls":[{"name":"run_command","args":{"CommandLine":"/mnt/home/japake298/project/GraphConjecturing/.venv/bin/python3 -c \"\nimport itertools\nfrom collections import deque\n\ndef bfs_ecc(adj, n, v):\n    dist = {v: 0}\n    q = deque([v])\n    while q:\n        curr = q.popleft()\n        for nxt in adj[curr]:\n            if nxt not in dist:\n                dist[nxt] = dist[curr] + 1\n                q.append(nxt)\n    if len(dist) < n:\n        return None\n    return max(dist.values())\n\nfor n in range(2, 9):\n    adj = {i: [] for i in range(n)}\n    for i in range(n - 1):\n        adj[i].append(i + 1)\n        adj[i + 1].append(i)\n    for f in itertools.product([0, 1, 2], repeat=n):\n        valid = True\n        for v in range(n):\n            if f[v] == 0:\n                if not any(f[u] == 2 for u in adj[v]):\n                    valid = False\n                    break\n        if not valid:\n            continue\n        W = sum(f)\n        centers_2 = [v for v in range(n) if f[v] == 2]\n        if centers_2:\n            min_ecc_2 = min(bfs_ecc(adj, n, v) for v in centers_2)\n            if min_ecc_2 > W - 1:\n                print(f'COUNTEREXAMPLE to min_ecc_2 <= W-1 on P_{n}: W={W}, f={f}, min_ecc_2={min_ecc_2}')\nprint('Done checking P_n!')\n\"","Cwd":"/mnt/home/japake298/project/GraphConjecturing/handoff/promising13/task_e20263a9","RunPersistent":false,"WaitMsBeforeAsync":5000,"toolAction":"Testing min_ecc_2 <= W-1 on paths","toolSummary":"Test min_ecc_2 on paths"}}]}
